 the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 4 grids. September to October came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025, October to November came in at 39% of normal. In 2026 so far, March to April came in at 46% of normal, and grid 20907 shows a preliminary August to September 2026 estimate of 90.5.</p>"}
